   "text": "Not consulted: rm's info manual, the web, PaSh's code. Thick arrows mark the main contribution to a file; thin arrows mark a single fact or convention.\nNo arrow reaches rm.json from the probes: its content is the sample's. The same 27 probes are the only runs of rm; nothing checks the files after they were written.",
